Package: secubox-picobrew
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0), python3-uvicorn | python3-pip,
         python3-fastapi | python3-pip,
         lxc, debootstrap, sudo
Recommends: unbound
Description: PicoBrew appliance host (LXC) for SecuBox — phase 1
 Ports "secubox-app-picobrew" from OpenWrt: hosts an LXC container running
 the upstream picobrew_pico server, giving a second life to PicoBrew
 appliances (Pico S/C/Pro, Z Series, Zymatic) whose manufacturer cloud has
 been shut down since 2020.
 .
 Phase 1 scope:
  - picobrewctl: root-audited lifecycle (install/start/stop/status/update/logs)
    for the LXC, delegated to via sudo from an unprivileged FastAPI panel
  - Local DNS rewrite of picobrew.com to the LXC (device otherwise unreachable)
  - TLS termination in front of the picobrew_pico server for the Z series
  - Admin panel exposing container state and start/stop controls
 .
 Fermentation/temperature tracking (sensors, profiles, recipes, Tilt/
 iSpindel, alerts) is out of scope for this phase and will ship in a later
 phase; the existing sensor controller code is preserved untouched in
 lib/stillwatch/ for that purpose.
